   "stem": {
      "text": "Let k(x) = sqrt(12 - 3x) / ((x - 1)(x^2 - 16)). Consider the largest interval that contains x = 2 and on which k is continuous. What is the sum of the integers in that interval?"
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "numeric",
      "mathjson": 5
   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The radicand requires 12 - 3x >= 0, so x <= 4, and the denominator (x - 1)(x - 4)(x + 4) is zero at x = -4, 1 and 4, so x = 4 is excluded even though the radicand allows it.",
         "mathjson": [
            "Multiply",
            [
               "Subtract",
               "x",
               1
            ],
            [
               "Subtract",
               "x",
               4
            ],
            [
               "Add",
               "x",
               4
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "k is a quotient of a square root function and a polynomial, each continuous on its domain, so k is continuous on (-infinity, -4) U (-4, 1) U (1, 4).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            [
               "Sqrt",
               [
                  "Subtract",
                  12,
                  [
                     "Multiply",
                     3,
                     "x"
                  ]
               ]
            ],
            [
               "Multiply",
               [
                  "Subtract",
                  "x",
                  1
               ],
               [
                  "Subtract",
                  [
                     "Power",
                     "x",
                     2
                  ],
                  16
               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "The piece that contains x = 2 is (1, 4), open at 1 and open at 4 because the denominator is zero at both. Its integers are 2 and 3.",
         "mathjson": [
            "Add",
            2,
            3
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "The sum of those integers is 5.",
         "mathjson": 5
      }
   ],
